WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:07.701
Systems as a first AC. Camera wrap isn't your wrap, and your timesheet shows it.

2
00:00:07.951 --> 00:00:14.902
Your own wrap time, after de-rig and kit return, sits next to the unit wrap.

3
00:00:15.152 --> 00:00:22.902
Overtime is worked out at your own grade, so a shared sheet never gives everyone one multiplier.

4
00:00:23.152 --> 00:00:29.702
Small kit fees, like monitors and follow focus, can be added to any day.

5
00:00:29.952 --> 00:00:37.304
Fill in your passport once. A production only sees your details after you accept the job.

6
00:00:37.554 --> 00:00:44.504
And the rate card already has your grade in it.

